{"pageid":1645,"title":"Pedestal","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Pedestal</span>","revid":18034,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d2/Pedestal.in.rock.spirals.png/revision/latest?cb=20230820145503\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"A pedstal near rock spirals\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/d2/Pedestal.in.rock.spirals.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20230820145503\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"169\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Pedestal.in.rock.spirals.png\" data-image-key=\"Pedestal.in.rock.spirals.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Pedestal.in.rock.spirals.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">A pedstal near rock spirals</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><b>Pedestals</b> were carried over from the old map and function in the same manner. They are located in 4 places; near <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_Auto\" title=\"Alan&#39;s Auto\"><b>Alan's</b> <b>auto</b></a>, near <a href=\"/wiki/Skull_Rock\" title=\"Skull Rock\"><b>Skull rock</b></a>, near the <a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\"><b>lighthouse</b></a> (In the Lost Woods), and on the rocky spikes.\n</p><p>The pedestals are used for obtaining both the <a href=\"/wiki/Uncertain_Pickaxe\" title=\"Uncertain Pickaxe\"><b>Uncertain Pickaxe</b></a> and the <b><a href=\"/wiki/Key\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Key\">Adurite Key</a>.</b>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903034517\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.010 seconds\nPreproce